{"synopsis":"Sebagai kapten Legiun Divine dan Awakener terkuat, Bai Yi dikhianati oleh seorang kawan, menyaksikan semua rekan satu timnya mati di depan matanya. Baru setelah itu dia menyadari bahwa dia selalu menjadi pion dari mereka yang berkuasa. Setelah kehilangan segalanya, dia terlahir kembali 20 tahun yang lalu, kembali ke masa sekolah menengahnya sebelum terbangun.\n\nSaat itu, keluarga dan rekan satu timnya masih hidup. Untuk menyelamatkan mereka, untuk membalaskan dendam pengkhianat, dan untuk menggulingkan seluruh sistem pemerintahan yang korup, ia memulai jalan kekuatan yang sepi.","alternative_title":"全职觉醒","author":"绘世TONY","artist":"绘世TONY","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"4e5a74e2-e0b6-42e4-b6ea-0b60e5f5d16f","number":"138","chapter":"138","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"d29b1524-0c43-40b0-bc73-d3c5b99a956c","number":"137","chapter":"137","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"fa2554e0-620c-493c-82cb-243044404014","number":"136","chapter":"136","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28"},{"chapter_id":"03e2adfb-871d-4dab-ba71-d603cc642a61","number":"135","chapter":"135","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28"},{"chapter_id":"7b859127-0d0f-4895-91a3-53d1c13e758a","number":"134","chapter":"134","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"40cbdc8d-9420-4635-b8a9-c6c0601a70e6","number":"133","chapter":"133","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"80fe3105-9ca7-4df5-af8b-361e54419f1f","number":"132","chapter":"132","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"788f3231-57e1-42b6-add7-9a84783f6f27","number":"131","chapter":"131","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"a42b42c3-3d56-475f-8ae0-d267641015e2","number":"130","chapter":"130","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"eb23a1b9-5e63-4a17-ac2b-5a285a82f6fc","number":"12